# Generated fresh on every self-hosted deploy by `generate-changelog` — see
# .github/workflows/pages.yml. Never committed, same as GameEngine's own
# CHANGELOG generation.
/CHANGELOG.md

# The docs/ Docusaurus project's generated output. Repeated from
# docs/.gitignore because git is not the only reader: prettier defaults its
# --ignore-path to the *root* .gitignore and .prettierignore, and eslint's
# flat config defaults to ignoring only node_modules — neither descends into
# a nested .gitignore, so without these `npm run check` fails on generated
# files the moment anyone builds the docs site.
docs/build/
docs/.docusaurus/
